  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1117880.svg\" alt=\"title\"></p>\n<div><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-blue?style=plastic&link=https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/\" alt=\"Static Badge\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-lime?style=plastic&link=https://neoforged.net/\" alt=\"Static Badge\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-yellow?style=plastic&link=https://fabricmc.net/\" alt=\"Static Badge\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Приложения рецептов Applied Energistics без ограничений certus</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Список функций:</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- Полностью убрать_spawn_ метеоритов ae2 на мире</span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- Замена certus polvere на кремний с песком вinscriptionере</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/EZ ae2/screen/inscriber.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"343\" height=\"493\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- Замена некоторых рецептов на такие материалы, как железо и кварц</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/EZ ae2/screen/kable.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"392\" height=\"205\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/EZ ae2/screen/shaped.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"381\" height=\"577\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- Полная переработка рецептов печатных процессоров без прессов</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/EZ ae2/screen/shapeless.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"384\" height=\"775\"></span></p>",
